            "review_title": "Review at Kathiroll Kafe",
            "review_text": "Tronzzi\nHanoi, Vietnam14 contributions\n0\nI loved it!\nSep 2017 • Friends\nWe stopped here for dinner and we are so glad we did. They have many options for you to choose with many flavors. The Kathiroll was crispy outside and soft inside. Also well priced and in a great location. Super nice owner. If you're in the area, it's definitely worth a try! 5* for customer service. Thank you Kathiroll!\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 21, 2018",
